177/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=www","reason":null}},{"publicId":"public-rss-2aa4c7e14bf5c0fd7607ea772e8005aa1887e1c6a7033c31755aff5b61c52649","contentType":"race_news","state":"ready","titleZh":"维斯塔潘：红牛在蒙扎像“乌龟”","summaryZh":"马克斯·维斯塔潘在周六表示红牛赛车像纸做的，但周日他却在蒙扎主直道上方的标志性领奖台上获得了季军。赛后他表示，正赛速度比排位赛后预期的要好得多，但他也强调，赛车的问题依然存在。","publishedAt":"2026-09-07T08:15:40.879Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-09-06T18:27:01.000Z","sourceTimeStatus":"known","source":{"sourceId":"motorsport-f1-news","platform":"rss","displayName":"Motorsport.com","byline":"Motorsport.com","accessStatus":"available"},"media":{"kind":"source_image","assetRef":"https://cdn-4.motorsport.com/images/amp/YXyK1qR6/s6/max-verstappen-red-bull-6.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":257454,"altZh":"维斯塔潘：红牛在蒙扎像“乌龟”"},"originalLink":{"enabled":true,"url":"https://www.motorsport.com/f1/news/how-max-verstappen-tried-to-compensate-for-feeling-like-a-turtle-against-mercedes-in-monza/10853173/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=www","reason":null}},{"publicId":"public-rss-a006dce357652df3e724a847ec8ec50026cde7aac06278d72f6b72fa43c091a5","contentType":"race_news","state":"ready","titleZh":"梅赛德斯解释为何未在虚拟安全车下召回拉塞尔：\"我们不知道哪种策略更好\"","summaryZh":"在意大利大奖赛中，基米·安东内利从队尾发车并最终夺冠，这得益于出色的驾驶，或许也离不开策略和及时的虚拟安全车的帮助。安东内利是梅赛德斯车队中唯一在比赛中进站的车手，最终击败了队友兼冠军竞争对手乔治·拉塞尔。梅赛德斯在两位车手之间采用了不同的策略，车队表示当时并不确定哪种策略更优。","publishedAt":"2026-09-07T08:40:01.439Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-09-06T17:31:10.000Z","sourceTimeStatus":"known","source":{"sourceId":"motorsport-f1-news","platform":"rss","displayName":"Motorsport.com","byline":"Motorsport.com","accessStatus":"available"},"media":{"kind":"source_image","assetRef":"https://cdn-1.motorsport.com/images/amp/YvKBPrE6/s6/george-russell-mercedes.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":329828,"altZh":"梅赛德斯解释为何未在虚拟安全车下召回拉塞尔：\"我们不知道哪种策略更好\""},"originalLink":{"enabled":true,"url":"https://w